    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Poetry Chatbot\r\n\r\nThis chatbot has been designed to help generate poetry on a given topic. You can ask it to generate a poem on a certain topic, and it will respond with a poem. Let's try to adjust the temperature and see how it affects the chatbot.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1) Update the temperature of the chatbot so it can generate creative poetry on a given topic.\r\n    - The results should be _creative_ and _expressive_\r\n    - **Remember to press the <code style=\"color:white; background-color:#7435b2\">Update</code> button each time you change the temperature!**\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n::: details [**Click here to see example messages to try in this level**]\r\n* Write me a poem about love and jealousy\r\n* Write me a poem about a walrus and a carpenter\r\n* Write me an ode to the sun\r\n:::\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
